<title>USA: Ameriquest chief executive to resign.</title>
<headline>Ameriquest chief executive to resign.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA ANA, Calif. 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>AmeriQuest Technologies Inc said Tuesday its Chairman and Chief Executive Officer Steve DeWindt will resign at the end of the month.</p>
<p>DeWindt, who grew up in Southern California, said the decision was because the company is moving to Florida and not due to any other reason.</p>
<p>Harry Krischik, current co-chairman of AmeriQuest will assume the chairman of the board position immediately.</p>
<p>The company said there will be no replacement for the CEO position.</p>
</text>
